msgstr "Cambia chiave"

#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/settings/mod.rs:803
msgid "Turn off sync?"
msgstr "Disattivare la sincronizzazione?"

#: crates/cineo-desktop/src/settings/mod.rs:805
msgid ""
"This device stops syncing and keeps its library. The data on the server "
